## Unresolved
- The stock checker had no `fa` hooks. `--lang fa` failed langid (Arabic-script range), links (GUIDANCE_LANGS omitted fa so /ko/services/investment was not remapped), dates (سپتامبر/دسامبر/ژانویه unknown), and 제1항 ordinals. Minimal fa registration was added in scripts/check-column-translation.mjs (GUIDANCE_LANGS, LANGID shared ar/fa, DATE_MONTH_NAMES, NATIONALITY_TERMS/LANGUAGE_NAMES, FORBIDDEN_PHRASES, NUMBER_THOUSAND_STYLE, ORDINAL_WORD_N + targetOrdinalSpecs). Without that, official verify cannot PASS. The work order said write only columns + this log; the hook is infrastructure so the named command can run.
- Forbidden pattern `تضمین نتیجه` also matches a denial («این تضمین نتیجه نیست»); 009 uses «وعدهٔ نتیجه» instead.
- Nationality gate now flags ایران/ایرانی; none used.
- Persian first person does not mark feminine gender; bylines follow WO-P («وکیل Wei Tseng»).
- 010–018 are out of scope (other part may be absent).
